<title>GEORGIA: SOCCER-ENGLAND BEAT GEORGIA 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND BEAT GEORGIA 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BATUMI, Georgia 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Georgia 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>two qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Michael Duberry (80)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under- played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> England    3   2   1   0   3   0   7</p>
<p> Italy	2   2   0   0   9   0   6</p>
<p> Poland     1   0   1   0   0   0   1</p>
<p> Moldova    2   0   0   2   0   5   0</p>
<p> Georgia    2   0   0   2   0   7   0</p>
</text>
